(footprint "T50-43_Vertical_Bifilar_HandWound"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "manual")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Amidon T50-43 ferrite toroid (type 43 material, OD 12.70 mm x ID 7.70 mm x H 4.83 mm -- same physical dimensions as T50-6, different material mix). Mounted VERTICALLY (standing on edge, hole axis parallel to PCB). Hand-wound BIFILAR (two independent windings twisted together, 4 pads total). Used in Rev D for T2 bifilar drain-feed choke on ss_pa: pads 1,2 = winding A (pins 1 = +13.8V, 2 = Q4 drain), pads 3,4 = winding B (pins 3 = +13.8V, 4 = Q3 drain). Top-down projection = rectangle OD (12.70 mm) x H (4.83 mm). Two 3.1 mm NPTH zip-tie holes on the midline at (0, +/-3.5) secure the toroid; a single zip tie wraps over the top crossing the thin H dimension. Four wire pads at (+/-3.0, +/-4.5) accommodate the two bifilar lead pairs. VERIFY dimensions against actual stock before fab.")
	(tags "toroid ferrite t50-43 amidon type-43 vertical edge hand-wound bifilar drain-feed")
